{"about_the_game":"One day the sun disappeared, and now ghosts run rampant while humanity dwindles. Several years on, two siblings are pulled into a story much grander than their simple life in the darkness when a mysterious woman calls on them for help.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/extras/578c8226a872cf25ac15820a9d33c8ac.avif?t=1735930838\" width=600 height=120 /></span><br><br>Travel through a world of dreams, chasing down the man who can change everything. Recruit a team of survivors along the way and experience their stories and grow closer together at your evolving base camp.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/extras/cbc6c6aef1dfe863095fd7a1a7c63655.poster.avif?t=1735930838\" width=600 height=285 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/extras/cbc6c6aef1dfe863095fd7a1a7c63655.webm?t=1735930838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Ghosts hide all around you, but with the help of your ghost companion Mac you can take them down in game-show style RPG battles. Gain experience and upgrade your party members with unique movesets and game-changing skills. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/extras/4a6b650d6fa1fdba617a1d9b3c047d5c.poster.avif?t=1735930838\" width=600 height=285 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/extras/4a6b650d6fa1fdba617a1d9b3c047d5c.webm?t=1735930838\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Choose a Gameplay Style:</strong><br><br><strong>Countdown</strong>: A focus on strategy and time-management, aim to complete your adventure within a limited number of in-game days.<br><strong>Casual</strong>: Experience the story at your own pace with no limitations, and less challenge.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>a hand-crafted Open World<br></li><li>8 Playable Party Members<br></li><li>over 100 Unique Enemies<br></li><li>low damage numbers<br></li><li>no random Encounters<br></li><li>no cluttered inventory<br></li><li>Upgrade your Basecamp<br></li><li>original Soundtrack By Floopy</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/extras/d142e6710005b00754b949e10725ef6c.avif?t=1735930838\" width=600 height=164 /></span></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2139770?t=1735930838","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1735930838","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1735930838","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2139770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1735930838","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"One day the sun disappeared, and now ghosts run rampant while humanity dwindles. Several years on, two siblings are pulled into a story much grander than their simple life in the darkness when a mysterious woman calls on them for help.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/